# Cloudflare Pages → nowssb (this site) → Settings → Variables and Secrets → Production
# Needed by functions/api/pay/{order,verify,webhook}.js (Razorpay subscriptions).
# Names only — never commit real values; add them as encrypted "Secret" variables.
#
# Razorpay Dashboard → Account & Settings → API Keys (live mode):
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
# Razorpay Dashboard → Webhooks → Add: URL https://nowssb.com/api/pay/webhook,
# events payment.captured + order.paid, and the secret you type there:
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# Firebase console → Project settings → Service accounts → Generate new private
# key; paste the whole JSON. (FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT is used instead if this one is
# absent and it holds the same Firebase Admin service-account JSON.)
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=
# Already set:
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=nowssb-34f1b
#
# Until all of these exist, /api/pay/* answers 501 naming what is missing and
# the website shows "Payments are not available right now" — nothing is granted.
# Offline test: node tools/pay/pay-functions.test.mjs
